      \
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
    \cf4 \uc0\u8232 
\fs32 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 Then run 
\fs28 pixi install
\fs32  to download and install the package.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf4 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
