\fs28 main
\fs32  branch, clone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/forfudan/decimo"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul this GitHub repository}} and build the package locally using the command 
\fs28 pixi run package
\fs32 .\
