\fs64 \cf0 \cb1 Objective\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf4 Financial calculations and data analysis require precise decimal arithmetic that floating-point numbers cannot reliably provide. As someone working in finance and credit risk model validation, I needed a dependable correctly-rounded, fixed-precision numeric type when migrating my personal projects from Python to Mojo.\
Since Mojo currently lacks a native Decimal type in its standard library, I decided to create my own implementation to fill that gap.\
This project draws inspiration from several established decimal implementations and documentation, e.g., {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.python.org/3/library/decimal.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul Python built-in 
\fs28 \cf4 \ulc4 Decimal
\fs32 \cf7 \ulc7  type}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.rs/rust_decimal/latest/rust_decimal/index.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul Rust 
\fs28 \cf4 \ulc4 rust_decimal
\fs32 \cf7 \ulc7  crate}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.decimal.getbits?view=net-9.0&redirectedfrom=MSDN#System_Decimal_GetBits_System_Decimal_"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul Microsoft's 
\fs28 \cf4 \ulc4 Decimal
\fs32 \cf7 \ulc7  implementation}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://speleotrove.com/decimal/decarith.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul General Decimal Arithmetic Specification}}, etc. Many thanks to these predecessors for their contributions and their commitment to open knowledge sharing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa530\partightenfactor0

\fs64 \cf0 Status\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf4 Rome wasn't built in a day. Decimo is currently under active development. It has successfully progressed through the "make it work" phase and the "make it right", and is now well into the "make it fast" phase.\
The 
\fs28 BInt
\fs32  type is fully implemented and optimized. It has been benchmarked against Python's 
\fs28 int
\fs32  and demonstrates superior performance in most cases.\
Bug reports and feature requests are welcome! If you encounter issues, please {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/forfudan/decimo/issues"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul file them here}}.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa530\partightenfactor0

